      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Binford%2C_North_Dakota",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Since 1999, the festival has included the Binford Bull Ride, a sanctioned Professional Bull Riders event drawing about 2,500–3,000 spectators each year.",
